  "authoringNotes": "Measured 11 geometric islands: connected furry body/legs use anatomical capsule fields with smooth shoulder, knee and paw transitions; all five separate crown spikes are rigid to torso, eyes/teeth follow the local head and the curled tail has its measured root. Foot anchors come from the source support-surface slices. Final walk must use the retargeted user-owned Meshy Walking keyframes. A separate central ventral field owns the 65 measured low-belly vertices (Y .070\u2013.098m, |X|<.118m) while keeping the outboard paws limb-owned. Sole vertices below Y .035m are wholly Foot-owned; lower-leg influence begins above that support band and blends into the raised paw through Y .13m.",
